Local adaptations include native PowerPoint geometry, crop/rich-text/group/shape
support, theme correctness, scientific-original source exceptions, UTF-8 subprocess
handling, local Office rendering and stronger input/output protection. New helper
scripts and workflow documents package the scientific representation contract.

No user manuscripts, slides, credentials or task-specific Figure mappings are
distributed in this skill. A run's data remains in its separate run directory.
